{"3746970": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Castella", "steam_appid": 3746970, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Defend Your Castle</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Castella is a Tower Defense Rogue-like, where you will build a fortress to defend yourself from hordes of monsters besieging your castle. During the game you will unlock and upgrade a great variety of towers and buildings. You will build walls to block the path and defend your resources and your Castle.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3746970/extras/cccc49ba80d02de720924cdd6af9d557.poster.avif?t=1779703787\" width=1170 height=498 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3746970/extras/cccc49ba80d02de720924cdd6af9d557.webm?t=1779703787\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3746970/extras/cccc49ba80d02de720924cdd6af9d557.mp4?t=1779703787\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Upgrades</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your choices matter, depending on what you choose, you will unlock 14 deadly towers and over 30 unique upgrades, make your castle more resistant, or improve your economy.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3746970/extras/8d8a1fe07675f05048113e1f15be2c29.poster.avif?t=1779703787\" width=1170 height=498 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3746970/extras/8d8a1fe07675f05048113e1f15be2c29.webm?t=1779703787\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3746970/extras/8d8a1fe07675f05048113e1f15be2c29.mp4?t=1779703787\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Map</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You will study the terrain to create chokeholds and gain greater advantage against the enemy or completely cut their path, in 2 types of procedurally generated Maps.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3746970/extras/b344a39790b67cef0c701c6002bb51b3.poster.avif?t=1779703787\" width=1170 height=498 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3746970/extras/b344a39790b67cef0c701c6002bb51b3.webm?t=1779703787\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3746970/extras/b344a39790b67cef0c701c6002bb51b3.mp4?t=1779703787\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Enemies</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There are over 17 Enemy types, and they have different Objectives, some will destroy your walls, while others will focus your Economy. They all have a common objective, <u><strong>Destroy Your Castle !!</strong></u></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3746970/extras/be07eba900ff103c60d62083c74aac37.poster.avif?t=1779703787\" width=1170 height=498 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3746970/extras/be07eba900ff103c60d62083c74aac37.webm?t=1779703787\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3746970/extras/be07eba900ff103c60d62083c74aac37.mp4?t=1779703787\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3746970/extras/344e73778df5e8c9dd016f6e0b16cf0e.poster.avif?t=1779703787\" width=1170 height=498 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3746970/extras/344e73778df5e8c9dd016f6e0b16cf0e.webm?t=1779703787\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3746970/extras/344e73778df5e8c9dd016f6e0b16cf0e.mp4?t=1779703787\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Economy</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You will also mine resources like mana, gold, iron and stone all around the map, which are needed to construct your buildings. But be careful, the enemy is greedy and will attack them in sight, don't let them get too close.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3746970/extras/8e8f5f89de4e95b1d7402ae0eb25159e.poster.avif?t=1779703787\" width=1170 height=498 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3746970/extras/8e8f5f89de4e95b1d7402ae0eb25159e.webm?t=1779703787\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3746970/extras/8e8f5f89de4e95b1d7402ae0eb25159e.mp4?t=1779703787\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>", "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Defend Your Castle</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Castella is a Tower Defense Rogue-like, where you will build a fortress to defend yourself from hordes of monsters besieging your castle. During the game you will unlock and upgrade a great variety of towers and buildings. You will build walls to block the path and defend your resources and your Castle.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3746970/extras/cccc49ba80d02de720924cdd6af9d557.poster.avif?t=1779703787\" width=1170 height=498 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3746970/extras/cccc49ba80d02de720924cdd6af9d557.webm?t=1779703787\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3746970/extras/cccc49ba80d02de720924cdd6af9d557.mp4?t=1779703787\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Upgrades</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your choices matter, depending on what you choose, you will unlock 14 deadly towers and over 30 unique upgrades, make your castle more resistant, or improve your economy.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3746970/extras/8d8a1fe07675f05048113e1f15be2c29.poster.avif?t=1779703787\" width=1170 height=498 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3746970/extras/8d8a1fe07675f05048113e1f15be2c29.webm?t=1779703787\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3746970/extras/8d8a1fe07675f05048113e1f15be2c29.mp4?t=1779703787\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Map</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You will study the terrain to create chokeholds and gain greater advantage against the enemy or completely cut their path, in 2 types of procedurally generated Maps.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" 